From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kcm_cellularnetwork: SIM for mobile data, SIM for calls and messages, SIM names and icons
Description:
 The main page follows the modem for mobile data instead of the first modem
 and, with more than one modem, offers the choice "SIM for mobile data";
 choosing a SIM enables mobile data on it and disables it on the others.
 The choice "SIM for calls and messages" sets the SIM the dialer and the
 messaging application use unless another one is chosen for a call or a
 message. Both choices list the SIMs in the order of their slots. SIMs are
 listed with their name ("SIM <slot>") and icon, the SIM page lets the user
 choose the icon of the SIM out of the shared set. The page of a modem is
 named after its SIM instead of the object number.
 .
 While a modem goes away and comes back (e.g. a modem object restarted by
 ModemManager) the pages show no modem instead of failing on a missing one;
 while mobile data moves to another SIM they show that the SIM is being
 switched. Errors of every modem are shown, not only those of the modem
 for mobile data. A choice in a SIM selection is always passed on, after
 it the selection shows the SIM actually in use. The list of SIMs is in
 the order of the slots.
 .
 The mobile data switch passes on changes by the user only (toggled):
 the flag that was to keep the switch from reacting to its own update was
 never reset after a change that took effect, so the next tap on the
 switch was ignored.
Forwarded: no
License: GPL-2.0-or-later (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
---
--- a/kcms/kcm_cellularnetwork/ui/ModemPage.qml
+++ b/kcms/kcm_cellularnetwork/ui/ModemPage.qml
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@ FormCard.FormCardPage {
     property Cellular.CellularModem modem
     property bool showExtra: false
 
-    title: i18n("Modem %1", modem.displayId)
+    title: (modem && modem.sim) ? i18nc("@title modem of a SIM", "Modem of %1", modem.sim.name) : i18n("Modem")
 
     MessagesList {
         Layout.fillWidth: true
--- a/kcms/kcm_cellularnetwork/ui/SimPage.qml
+++ b/kcms/kcm_cellularnetwork/ui/SimPage.qml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ FormCard.FormCardPage {
     property Cellular.CellularSim sim: null
 
